      "sourceTextSha256": "1035021852679e131435417183c9fbf57c3f68adefb547f0eb0fe059da16e9ea",
      "text": "Ten days across three countries: the Carnival’s grand finale in Rio de Janeiro, the Parade of Champions, with Sugar Loaf and Christ the Redeemer; the Iguazu Falls from both the Brazilian and Argentine sides; Buenos Aires and its tango; and Santiago de Chile at the foot of the Andes, with an optional visit to the wineries of the Maipo Valley.",
